Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 19:53:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add agency management suite: pipeline, invoices, onboarding,
 delivery, referrals, time tracking + real theme toggle

- Project Pipeline: kanban (Lead -> Scoping -> Active -> Revision -> Delivered -> Invoiced)
- Invoice Manager: standalone invoicing with print output, mark-paid, overdue detection
- Client Onboarding: 5-step guided intake flow
- Delivery Pages: branded shareable client handoff pages (public /delivery/:id route + admin manager)
- Referral Tracker: referral log + leaderboard + reward tracking
- Time & Profit Tracker: session-based time logging with per-project effective hourly rate
- ThemeContext: real dark/light toggle with localStorage persistence, replacing the old hardcoded PermanentDarkMode
- New nav entries wired into admin sidebar
